    "text": "What is the molar solubility of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> in <math><mn>0.2</mn></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> solution? Given that, solubility product of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Al</mi><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msup></math> :",
