  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Concept of common <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> will be applicable for <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> group.</p><p><math><mtext>Al</mtext><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>OH</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8652;</mo><munder><mrow><mtext>A</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3+</mtext></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mtext>S&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mtext><mtext>&#160;</mtext></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>O</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> for <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Looking at <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>,</mo></math> it is clear that <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> will be much lesser than <math><mn>0.2</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Or, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#8810;</mo><mn>0.2</mn></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2.4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>0.008</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br />or, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
